# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:17

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:17
translate italian adrian3b_bdd6187c:

    # "I sit down at the computer and install the game that Adrian had bought for me."
    "Mi siedo al computer e installo il gioco che Adrian mi ha comprato."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:18
translate italian adrian3b_3e2f7daf:

    # "It doesn't take too long, then it is on my desktop."
    "Non ci vuole molto, poi lo vedo sul mio desktop."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:19
translate italian adrian3b_e481cbc4:

    # "I guess I'll give it a try."
    "Credo che gli darò una prova."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:21
translate italian adrian3b_8131ccda:

    # "I start up the game and choose the server that Adrian had written down for me so that we could play together."
    "Avvio il gioco e scelgo il server che Adrian mi aveva annotato, così potremo giocare insieme."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:22
translate italian adrian3b_62dfcc6e:

    # "First thing I have to do is create a character."
    "La prima cosa che devo fare è creare un personaggio."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:24
translate italian adrian3b_59517f82:

    # "I spend probably too much time going through all the different options, before deciding on the character I want to play."
    "Passo probabilmente troppo tempo a esaminare tutte le diverse opzioni, prima di decidere quale personaggio voglio interpretare."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:25
translate italian adrian3b_827389d1:

    # "I know that Adrian is playing a magic-user, so I want to go with something more physical and melee-focused."
    "So che Adrian sta giocando con un mago, quindi voglio optare per qualcosa di più fisico e incentrato sul combattimento corpo a corpo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:27
translate italian adrian3b_c19763c8:

    # "I end up going with a half-orc warrior. I like the idea of fighting all these enemies up close and personal."
    "Alla fine scelgo un guerriero mezzo orco. Mi piace l’idea di combattere tutti questi nemici a distanza ravvicinata."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:28
translate italian adrian3b_112c09f7:

    # "He is also the biggest, most badass character that I could make."
    "È anche il personaggio più grosso e tosto che potessi creare."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:30
translate italian adrian3b_8f0fae1d:

    # "I turn up the volume and start the game."
    "Alzo il volume e avvio il gioco."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:31
translate italian adrian3b_4d69dd27:

    # "After a little intro movie, it drops me into the world."
    "Dopo un breve filmato introduttivo, vengo catapultato nel mondo di gioco."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:32
translate italian adrian3b_62775756:

    # "I wonder if Adrian is online right now? She said she would be. I type her username into the search window and find her."
    "Chissà se Adrian è online in questo momento? Aveva detto che lo sarebbe stata. Digito il suo nome utente nella finestra di ricerca e la trovo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:33
translate italian adrian3b_03467b31:

    # "So I send her a voicechat request, which she answers almost immediately."
    "Le mando una richiesta di chat vocale, alla quale risponde quasi immediatamente."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:35
translate italian adrian3b_a3f59b75:

    # gg "[pcname]! You're here!"
    gg "[pcname]! Sei qui!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:36
translate italian adrian3b_589ce956:

    # pc "I'm here. Hey, Adrian."
    pc "Sono qui. Ehi, Adrian."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:37
translate italian adrian3b_0ec64e72:

    # gg "Where are you right now?"
    gg "Dove ti trovi adesso?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:38
translate italian adrian3b_2730945b:

    # pc "I'm not sure. Wherever you start as with a half-orc."
    pc "Non ne sono sicuro. Dove si parte di solito con un mezzo orco."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:39
translate italian adrian3b_3292efd3:

    # gg "Oh, you're in Arigamir. Okay, I'll teleport there in just a minute."
    gg "Oh, sei ad Arigamir. Ok, mi teletrasporterò lì tra un minuto."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:40
translate italian adrian3b_b9029897:

    # pc "Okay. I'm just doing some of this tutorial stuff."
    pc "Ok. Sto solo seguendo un po’ di tutorial."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:43
translate italian adrian3b_0520cb55:

    # "After a minute or so, Adrian's character \"Trenoxa\", who I recognize from playing before walks up to me."
    "Dopo circa un minuto, il personaggio di Adrian, “Trenoxa”, che riconosco per averci giocato in passato, mi si avvicina."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:44
translate italian adrian3b_2116c262:

    # gg "Wow, you're a big guy, huh?"
    gg "Wow, sei un tipo tosto, eh?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:45
translate italian adrian3b_55e9779d:

    # pc "Yeah, I wanted to play a big melee character."
    pc "Sì, volevo giocare con un personaggio grande e grosso da combattimento corpo a corpo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:46
translate italian adrian3b_fd3dc2df:

    # gg "Well I'm not complaining."
    gg "Beh, non mi lamento certo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:47
translate italian adrian3b_33a9a8b1:

    # gg "Want to go kill some stuff?"
    gg "Ti va di andare a uccidere qualche mostro?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:48
translate italian adrian3b_39757b54:

    # pc "Yeah, let's do it."
    pc "Sì, facciamolo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:51
translate italian adrian3b_c06aa83e:

    # "We spend the next hour or so doing various quests, killing monsters, and leveling up."
    "Passiamo l’ora successiva a svolgere varie missioni, uccidere mostri e salire di livello."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:52
translate italian adrian3b_44e05c13:

    # "She shows me the world a bit, shows me how to advance my character, and gives me a bunch of equipment to start with."
    "Mi fa vedere un po’ il mondo, mi spiega come far progredire il mio personaggio e mi dà un sacco di equipaggiamento per iniziare."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:53
translate italian adrian3b_606b69f6:

    # "Who needs a tutorial when I have her?"
    "Chi ha bisogno di un tutorial quando c’è lei?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:56
translate italian adrian3b_40c77f2c:

    # "Then we head back to the Inn, a place called \"The Feedmill\", and sit down for a drink together."
    "Poi torniamo alla locanda, un posto chiamato “The Feedmill”, e ci sediamo a bere qualcosa insieme."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:57
translate italian adrian3b_4a42f78f:

    # pc "That was really fun."
    pc "È stato davvero divertente."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:58
translate italian adrian3b_e7c80669:

    # gg "I'm glad you enjoyed it. I had a blast."
    gg "Sono contenta che ti sia piaciuto. Mi sono divertita un mondo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:59
translate italian adrian3b_31f7576c:

    # pc "Me too. I should be careful though. I could see myself really getting addicted to this game."
    pc "Anch’io. Dovrei stare attenta, però. Mi vedo già diventare davvero dipendente da questo gioco."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:60
translate italian adrian3b_0233efaf:

    # gg "You don't have to tell me about that. I play way too much."
    gg "Non c’è bisogno che me lo dici. Ci gioco davvero troppo."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:61
translate italian adrian3b_2d5d032d:

    # gg "It's good to play in short bursts though. Don't spend all day on here, you know?"
    gg "È bello giocarci a brevi intervalli, però. Non passare tutto il giorno qui, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:62
translate italian adrian3b_7acad64a:

    # pc "Right."
    pc "Giusto."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:63
translate italian adrian3b_79845768:

    # gg "Well, we should probably get off for today then, but I hope you'll come on here and play again with me soon."
    gg "Beh, allora per oggi dovremmo probabilmente chiudere, ma spero che tornerai presto a giocare con me."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:64
translate italian adrian3b_95e44169:

    # pc "I will. Thanks for showing me the ropes."
    pc "Lo farò. Grazie per avermi insegnato le basi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:65
translate italian adrian3b_b6875399:

    # gg "No problem. Keep fighting like that and you'll be max level in no time."
    gg "Nessun problema. Continua a dare il massimo e raggiungerai il livello massimo in men che non si dica."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:66
translate italian adrian3b_d91c0c89:

    # gg "I'll see you later, [pcname]."
    gg "Ci vediamo più tardi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:69
translate italian adrian3b_f4460497:

    # "With that, we log off together."
    "Detto questo, ci disconnettiamo insieme."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:2
    old "After Adrian gives you a copy of Souls of War to play with her,"
    new "Dopo che Adrian ti ha dato una copia di Souls of War per giocare con lei,"

    # game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian3b.rpy:3
    old "install it on the computer in your bedroom and play with her at night."
    new "la installi sul computer nella tua camera da letto e giochi con lei la sera."

